Origin
------

The app is the TV app of Orbit Store 1.2.0 (https://github.com/saawant12/orbit-store-ps5),
GPL-3.0-or-later: TV app version 1.5.0, title PPSA99177, content version
01.005.000.

  Source revision  e9768c1d82c12aec474d603f737990c7d7105e6d
                   (SOURCES.json "baseCommit" of the source bundle; the bundle
                   is a working-tree snapshot, "sourceTree"
                   25b90a016d2d94d8ae51f01f564a7e252f812c99)
  Source bundle    orbit-store-1.2.0-source-bundle.zip
                   SHA-256 b56b3bdcd00f5dbd05cfcc3e6a9af126039d47574c7a4892cdd016af3c710e95
  Source archive   orbit-store-1.2.0-source.tar.gz (inside the bundle)
                   SHA-256 ed191bf503516dcf77e5d5e723de9a907243ed6067cf8e6de427f9765179c150

What was taken from the source archive, byte for byte (then changed as the
section "Files changed for XENO STORE" lists):

  app/                    -> app/tv/ (every file: src/, host/, tests/, tools/,
                             tooling/, runtime/, third_party/, assets/,
                             sce_sys/, Makefile, README.md, Dockerfile,
                             .gitignore, .clang-format)
  i18n/                   -> app/tv/i18n/ (the 11 interface catalogues)
  licenses/ (the texts that cover the TV app) -> app/tv/licenses/:
                             GPL-3.0.txt, libwebp-BSD-3-Clause.txt,
                             libwebp-PATENTS.txt, libcxx-LLVM.txt,
                             libcxxabi-LLVM.txt, libunwind-LLVM.txt,
                             compiler-rt-LLVM.txt, zlib.txt, ps5-opengl/
                             (The bundle's other licence texts cover Orbit's
                             own backend and browser interface, which are not
                             part of this app.)

Generated files are not stored: .deps/, build/, dist/ and runtime/libc.prx
are made by the build. Built from this unmodified import with
tools/clang18-prefixmap as PS5_CLANG and the bundle's title (PPSA99177),
eboot.bin was
65807c313631ce997d2e70ecc85b48afbcafa20ed3e52e7d798e29cc4b067951 from two
different checkouts, and sce_module/libc.prx was
e6ff45d16adf687855cc3b33b0c8a4132b6504360b221e0a34c7e99fb3ba0036.


